# Regenerable heavy artifacts — rebuild with:
#   pipeline/render.py --srt-only <script>   (scratch VO wavs)
#   pipeline/render.py <script>              (preview mp4s; the committed ones
#                                             in exports/ are curated samples)
GT-RF-01/graphics/_tmp/
GT-RF-01/audio/vo-scratch/*.wav
__pycache__/
# NEVER commit rendered video/audio to the repository — previews are delivered
# out-of-band; the pipeline regenerates them from the scripts.
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mov
*.wav
GT-RF-01/exports/
